# A founder voice NHS imaging buyers and investors already trust.

.text {Extol Affiliates · Proposal} classname:{kicker}

The founder-led marketing system for Amit Chavda and DigitalClinic.ai.

.container classname:{placeholder}
    [One line: what DigitalClinic.ai does]

.row gap:{1.5cm}
    .container
        .text {19} classname:{stat}

        years in UK imaging
    .container
        .text {2} classname:{stat}

        audiences: NHS buyers, investors
    .container
        .text {1} classname:{stat}

        approval a week

Prepared for Amit Chavda · London, October 2026

.speakernote
    Open on the credibility gap: buyers and investors back founders they already know. Amit already has the career; this makes it visible.

# Amit has worked every side of UK imaging: clinic, NHS, vendor and industry body.

.text {Why Amit} classname:{kicker}

.grid columns:{4} gap:{12px}
    .container classname:{card}
        **Clinic** · 2007-2013

        Lead Radiographer, Brighton and Sussex University Hospital
    .container classname:{card}
        **NHS** · 2014-2018

        NHS England and commissioning analytics
    .container classname:{card}
        **Vendor** · 2018-now

        Siemens Healthineers, Ergéa, Radiobotics
    .container classname:{card you}
        **Industry voice** · 2026-now

        Vice Convenor, AXREM AI Special Focus Group

.container classname:{callout}
    Few AI founders have stood in the reading room, the commissioning meeting and the vendor pitch. That is DigitalClinic.ai's edge, and almost nobody outside his network sees it yet.

.container classname:{source}
    Source: LinkedIn work history via Apollo, October 2026. AXREM: UK trade association, 120+ member companies.

# Uche Nnene, met at the same event, has the same gap in finance. We've put the same engine to Effectivepoint.

.text {Same event, same gap} classname:{kicker}

.grid columns:{3} gap:{12px}
    .container classname:{card}
        **Who · Dr Uche Nnene FCCA**

        Co-founder, Effectivepoint. Former EY partner. ERP, Finance and AI transformation for CFOs. Met at [Event name].
    .container classname:{card}
        **The shared gap · expertise buyers can't see**

        Deep expertise and named results live in the work, not where senior buyers look. CFOs and NHS imaging leaders both pick people they already know.
    .container classname:{card dark}
        **The approach we've put to them**

        Watch buyers' posts · Draft comments and proof posts in the founder's voice · Approve, a minute each · Publish · Measure. First outcome: one Finance Director conversation started on LinkedIn.

.container classname:{callout}
    For Amit: the same buyer-comment engine on NHS imaging leaders' posts, alongside the weekly recording.

.container classname:{source}
    Effectivepoint named with permission [confirm with Uche before sending].

.speakernote
    We met them in the same room and the pattern is identical. Share the approach, never the other client's numbers.

# Two audiences, one voice: NHS buyers for pilots, investors for the raise.

.text {The goal} classname:{kicker}

.grid columns:{2} gap:{16px}
    .container classname:{card}
        **01 · Qualified conversations with NHS imaging buyers**

        Radiology leads, PACS/IT and procurement see a founder who knows their workflow. Every post leads to a page and a tracked enquiry route.
    .container classname:{card}
        **02 · Investor-ready credibility**

        A visible track record and audience that shortens diligence and warms investor introductions.

.container classname:{callout}
    Founder first. The DigitalClinic.ai page amplifies. Radiobotics and AXREM content stays out.

.speakernote
    Complication: a startup with no public voice starts every buyer and investor conversation cold.

# One recording a week becomes a week of founder content.

.text {How it works} classname:{kicker}

.grid columns:{6} gap:{10px}
    .container classname:{card you}
        **01 Record**

        One 30-min session (format to agree)
    .container classname:{card}
        **02 Edit**

        Full video and short clips
    .container classname:{card}
        **03 Package**

        Posts, article, newsletter, investor update
    .container classname:{card you}
        **04 Approve**

        One weekly review
    .container classname:{card}
        **05 Publish**

        Every channel, scheduled
    .container classname:{card}
        **06 Learn**

        The numbers set next week

.container classname:{callout}
    Dark steps are the only ones that need Amit. The DigitalClinic.ai website is home base: every post points to a page about Amit, the product, an article or a demo request.

# The engine already runs: four Extol agents, each with a sourced result.

.text {Running today} classname:{kicker}

.grid columns:{4} gap:{12px}
    .container classname:{card}
        .text {40%} classname:{stat}

        **LinkedIn Manager.** Invites accepted across 25 live personal brand campaigns.
    .container classname:{card}
        .text {+326.2%} classname:{stat}

        **AI Social Media Manager.** LinkedIn impressions over 90 days, one approval click per post.
    .container classname:{card}
        .text {57.4%} classname:{stat}

        **Lead Magnet Agent.** Open rate across 61 sequences.
    .container classname:{card}
        .text {2 min} classname:{stat}

        **Finance Handler Agent.** Call transcript to priced proposal, down from 2 days.

.container classname:{callout}
    Fixed price, agreed up front. Built in your accounts; you own everything. No lock-in.

.container classname:{source}
    Source: extol.si case studies; LinkedIn analytics to 29 Apr 2026; Instantly dashboard 29 Mar to 29 Apr 2026.

# The stack. One job each.

.text {The tools} classname:{kicker}

| Tool | Its job | What you get |
|------|---------|--------------|
| **ChatGPT** | The writer behind everything | Scripts, posts, articles, newsletters and investor updates, drafted from your recordings |
| **Higgsfield** | Video quality | Clean edits, subtitles, motion and covers. Full videos plus vertical shorts |
| **Apollo** | Lists, outreach, newsletter | Targeted NHS imaging buyer and investor lists, outreach sequences, the newsletter |
| **Bloggerly.ai** | SEO and AI search | Articles that rank on Google and show up in AI answers |
| **LinkedIn manager** | Authority and conversations | Founder profile, posting and engagement in your voice; DigitalClinic.ai page amplifies |

.container classname:{source}
    LinkedIn is the main channel for NHS and investor audiences. Full recordings go to YouTube; the newsletter doubles as the investor update.

